**Result**
- **Desktop:** every click on **Task Manager** opens a **new Task Manager tab/panel** (dockview), because `tasks` is `multiInstance` in `config/apps.js`.
- **Non-desktop (single/mobile):** the click still routes to the Task Manager view (`setActiveTab('tasks')` → route push) — no new-instance concept there.
- **All other apps** (Wiki, Git, Planning, etc. — not `multiInstance`) keep focusing/switching exactly as before.

